> “Do not modify files. Do not publish, resolve, or reply through the CLI.”

Source: [dev-review skill, In-app Ask replies](https://github.com/devdotfast/review/blob/cf455334cbe43036feb00f537777a96b06649233/packages/progressive-review/skills/dev-review/SKILL.md#in-app-ask-replies). This is an instruction from the repository, not a user-session quote or proof of runtime enforcement.

